     "speakerId": "sara",
     "targetText": "村の集会では有益な質問が提起されました。",
     "englishReference": "The village meeting raised useful questions.",
     "arabicTranslation": "اجتماع القرية أثار أسئلة مفيدة.",
     "pronunciation": "mura no shuukai deha yuueki na shitsumon ga teiki saremashita ."
    },
    {
     "speakerId": "khalid",
     "targetText": "いくつかの質問は後回しにしたほうがよいでしょう。",
     "englishReference": "Some questions are better left for later.",
     "arabicTranslation": "بعض الأسئلة من الأفضل تركها لوقت لاحق.",
     "pronunciation": "ikutsukano shitsumon ha atomawashi nishitahougayoideshou ."
    }
   ],
   "spoilerSafe": true
